  "Choices Type": "text",
  "Question": "Are the altitudes of an obtuse triangle outside the triangle? Which of the following statements is correct?",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "All three altitudes lie inside the triangle",
    "B": "The altitude to the side opposite the obtuse angle lies inside the triangle, and the other two lie outside",
    "C": "All three altitudes lie outside the triangle",
    "D": "Only one altitude lies outside the triangle"
  },
  "Correct Answer": "B",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "The altitude to the side opposite the obtuse angle lies inside the triangle. The altitudes drawn from the two acute-angle vertices to the opposite sides (extended) lie outside the triangle.",
